

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Programm ġestjoni-memorja: 0.

>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Ħruġ ikteb: ['last index of ord = '] + (( txt aħħar: ['ord'] ) - 0), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['index of ord = '] + (( txt sib: ['ord'] ) - 0), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['index of ad = '] + (( txt sib: ['ad'] ) - 0), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['last index of W = '] + (( txt aħħar: ['W'] ) - 0), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['last index of d = '] + (( txt aħħar: ['d'] ) - 0), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['txt equals Word Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Word Salad'] ), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['txt equals Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Ceasar Salad'] ), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), linja-ġdida.

Programm naddaf.

